  headerText: Learn to grab fruit
  contentText: "Press <b>Left Mouse Button (LMB)</b> on the <b>highlighted fruit
    button</b>, or press the <b>F key</b> to grab the <b>fruit</b> shown in the button.
    \n<b>NOTE:</b> Only the first three fruits can spawn: <b>Blueberry</b>, <b>Strawberry</b>,
    and <b>Plum</b>."
